                      "title": "Sign-ins over the range",
                      "description": "Completed sign-in round trips (the password sign-in's 200; Google's, GitHub's and a sign-in link's 302 back into the UI) over the dashboard's time range, from the API's request counter. A refused Google or GitHub sign-in answers 302 too, so this counts round trips, not successes.",
                      "gridPos": {
